Conterm-local, on top of 0002.

itijah v0.2.1 targets Zig 0.15. Zig compiles every dependency's
build.zig into the build runner, and itijah's (std.fs.cwd) and that of
its own uucode dependency fail under 0.17. Its library sources are
vendored into pkg/itijah instead, without the tests, and the module is
built from them with the singleton uucode module. ArrayList empty inits
use `.empty`, since 0.17's ArrayList has no field defaults.

Drop this file and restore the build.zig.zon entry once itijah ships a
release that builds under the pinned Zig.

