+# itijah
+
+Vendored from https://github.com/DiaaEddin/itijah v0.2.1 (MIT, see
+LICENSE): `src/` without `src/test/`, and with `lib.zig`'s
+imports of `src/test/` removed (Zig resolves every `@import` in a file,
+including those inside `test` blocks).
+
+The package's `build.zig` and its own `uucode` dependency stay out. Zig
+compiles every dependency's `build.zig` into the build runner, and both
+of those target Zig 0.15. The module is built from `src/lib.zig` and
+imports the singleton `uucode` module from `SharedDeps`.
